  "comments": "A \"rtsod rigs la 'bru 'joms\" is reported by Ral gri in the list of his compositions (ID:7112), along with a \"sa bcad\" and \"ti ka\" on the same work. The \"sa bcad\" likely corresponds to work (ID:4949) and the \"ti ka\" to (ID:4951).\r\nIn this catalogue, the expression \"'bru 'joms\" (word for word commentary) is also used for a work related to the Sambandha\u00adpar\u012bk\u1e63\u0101\u00adprakara\u1e47a (ID:3775), which could be work (ID:5900). In that case the entry \"rtsod rigs la 'bru 'joms\" might also be referring to a set of explanatory annotations written as interlinear notes to the base text. No such work is currently extant.\r\nSee also [FZ6N88AU]: 409.",
